<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:gx="http://www.google.com/kml/ext/2.2" xmlns:kml="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom">
<Document>
	<name>coast2012.kml</name>
	<description><![CDATA[
Newborough Warren seaward edge (dune edge), digitised by Martin Hollingham in
Google Earth Pro 7.3.7.1155 from imagery dated 2012-05-26.

Named for the IMAGERY date. Supplied as "Coast 26-5-2012.kml", filed 2026-08-28.

Part of a single-source modern series with coast2006.kml (imagery 2006-01-01)
and coast2020.kml (imagery 2020-04-24), comparable with the id=2 dune-edge line
of coast1899.kml. This line REPLACES DCoast_2015.kml as the intermediate epoch:
that line lies seaward of this one at 10 of 12 sampled longitudes despite being
three years later, which is impossible under monotonic retreat.
See data/geo/GEO_PROVENANCE.md.
]]></description>
